    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78335" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρᾰλῐταίνω</span></b> , aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ήλῐτον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>do amiss, sin</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦ μέγα δή τι παρήλιτον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					3.891
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσσα οἱ . . παρήλιτε</span>
			cj. in <i><span class="en">
