				13.400
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.
			pers., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦ ῥα θεοὺς . . παρήλιτες</span>
			<i>didst sin against</i> them, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.246
			</span></i>.</div>
